d expected frequencies among groups\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Quota sampling and survey weighting were employed to improve sample representativeness of the adult U.S. population by gender, age, and race/ethnicity.\"}, {\"loc\": \"figure 1\", \"q\": \"Adjusted odds ratios were estimated using an ordered logit model of handwashing\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}